## CLI reference

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `bundle exec frai generate task NAME` | Generate a task + Claude CLI command (`frai gt`) |
| `bundle exec frai generate pipeline NAME` | Generate a pipeline (`frai gp`) |
| `bundle exec frai generate agent NAME` | Generate an agent (`frai ga`) |
| `bundle exec frai remove task NAME` | Remove a task and its Claude CLI command (`frai rt`) |
| `bundle exec frai setup` | Register `mcp/*.rb` servers with Claude CLI (`frai s`) |
| `bundle exec frai destroy` | Clean up MCP servers and commands before deleting the project |
| `bundle exec frai list` | List all tasks, MCPs, pipelines, agents and shared directives (`frai l`) |
| `bundle exec frai exec CLASS_NAME [INPUT]` | Execute a task, pipeline, or agent (`frai e`) |
| `bundle exec frai exec ... --log PATH` | Execute and write output/errors to log file |
| `bundle exec frai console` | Interactive Ruby console with project loaded (`frai c`) |

